{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33767","headline":"鹿门夏日 · 皮日休","name":"鹿门夏日","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"满院松桂阴，日午却不知。\n山人睡一觉，庭鹊立未移。\n出檐趁云去，忘戴白接㒿。\n书眼若薄雾，酒肠如漏巵。\n身外所劳者，饮食须自持。\n何如便绝粒，直使身无爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33767.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33767","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}